Points of interest:

Everything is in src/Bedrock

Specs:
Specs/Field.v - specs for generic fields; contains instantiantion for prime-order fields

Instantiation of fields:
Field/Synthesis/Examples/bls12_prime.v - Synthesis of Bedrock2 functions for prime-order field
Field/Synthesis/Examples/bls12_Fp2 - Synthesis of Bedrock2 functions for quadratic field extension.

from_list is a an auxiliary function used for the group operation. Its spec can be found in AbstractField.v under section FromList.
Field/Synthesis/Examples/bls12_from_list - Version for base field used in G1.
Field/Synthesis/Examples/bls12_from_list_Fp2 - Version for extended field used in G2.

Implementations of curves:
Field/Synthesis/Examples/BLS12_G1.v - Synthesis of Bedrock2 function implementing the group operation on G1.
Field/Synthesis/Examples/BLS12_G2.v - Synthesis of Bedrock2 function implementing the group operation on G2.

Unverified Parts:
Unfinished implementation of scalarmultplication can be found here:
Group/CurveAdd

The Body of the loop (in LoopBody.v) consists of five lines of code (l. 145 in LoopBody.v)
The functions implementing store_zero_G, shift_scalar, group_cmov and ladderstep are found in
StorePointAtinfinity.v
BignumShift.v
CondMoveGroup.v
and
CurveAdd.v
respectively.

Some correctness proof are still missing; so it is expected that bugs still exist.

